    "detailed_description": "Hitstun is a turn based fighting game. Play cards in your hand to move and attack. Win the game by reducing your opponent's health points to zero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   <br><br>Chain your Attack cards in a combo to show off your skills and deal more damage. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Whether you like to play neutral, rush down, or zoning, express your playstyle with Movement cards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose between 8 different characters with all unique card lists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Hitstun is a turn based fighting game. Play cards in your hand to move and attack. Win the game by reducing your opponent's health points to zero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/e3b347fc922929b725b39f8115c19191.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>   <br><br>Chain your Attack cards in a combo to show off your skills and deal more damage. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/8dae3a90cf7a5ffa1932c1571691785a.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Whether you like to play neutral, rush down, or zoning, express your playstyle with Movement cards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/69a4f44d4ff0ead881cd60710cb8683f.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Choose between 8 different characters with all unique card lists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.poster.avif?t=1679960909\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.webm?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981350/extras/d134317c48b4f3fe11cc34c325ee8532.mp4?t=1679960909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
